acy", "In-house fabrication optimized for rapid deployment and expansion", "Licensed electrical contracting with deep expertise in low- and ultra-low-voltage systems", "OT cybersecurity services aligned with NIST and IEC 62443 standards", "Modular, scalable control panel manufacturing with build-to-print and custom design"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Easley, South Carolina -> db", "Custom control panel manufacturing (build-to-print and custom design) -> /", "In-house fabrication optimized for rapid deployment -> /", "SCADA & IoT system development -> /", "Robotic integration with collaborative robotics and vision systems -> /", "Modular motion & process control integration -> /", "Advanced analytics & AI integration with predictive maintenance -> /", "Licensed electrical contractor for low/ultra-low-voltage systems -> /", "Building Management Systems (BMS) & Electrical Power Management Systems (EPMS) -> /", "Structured cabling, fiber optics, industrial networking -> /", "OT cybersecurity risk assessments, secure architecture, network segmentation -> /", "Compliance audits aligned with NIST, IEC 62443 -> /", "Controls-centric installation services for third-party OEM equipment -> /", "Serves data centers, utilities, industrial infrastructure -> /", "Serves manufacturing and industrial sectors -> /", "OEM manufacturing and product development -> /about-us", "Engineering design with SolidWorks Electrical, E-Plan, AutoCAD -> /", "Proof of concept & feasibility studies -> /", "Technology implementation roadmaps -> /", "Emphasis on right-sized, future-proof solutions balancing efficiency and efficacy -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We specialize in custom control panels that streamline design, enhance reliability, and strictly adhere to a high expectation of quality. Our end-to-end services cover consultation, design, manufacturing, testing, and integration.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "",