UPDATE companies SET description='Desert Medical Equipment was founded in 2003 by Bryan Schultz and is headquartered in Las Vegas, Nevada. Schultz, who previously pioneered the concept of placing medical equipment on-site at hotels and convention centers, started the company to address the growing needs of travelers with disabilities.

The company provides mobility scooter and medical device rentals, including FAA-approved portable oxygen concentrators, to disabled travelers. Its service model covers equipment reservations, delivery and pickup, cleaning, maintenance, and 24/7 customer support. Desert Medical manages a rental fleet that serves hospitality and entertainment venues nationwide, with on-demand delivery that ensures equipment is waiting at the guest’s destination.

Primary customers are hotels, resorts, convention centers, and entertainment complexes in the hospitality and entertainment sectors. These partners rely on Desert Medical to handle mobility logistics for their guests with disabilities.

Schultz founded the company on a personal commitment to helping people with disabilities, a mission that drives its differentiation. Desert Medical emphasizes customer service leadership, offering emergency 24-hour device service and a seamless rental experience. It is one of only three providers in the United States that rent FAA-approved portable oxygen concentrators, a niche that underscores its specialized focus.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Mobility scooter rentals", "Medical device rentals", "Equipment reservations", "Equipment cleaning and maintenance", "24/7 customer support", "On-demand delivery and pickup", "FAA-approved portable oxygen concentrator rentals", "Mobility management for hospitality partners"], "industries": ["Hospitality", "Entertainment"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Mobility scooters", "Portable oxygen concentrators (FAA-approved)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Overnight delivery for oxygen concentrators; same-day delivery for booked equipment", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["One of only three U.S. providers renting FAA-approved portable oxygen concentrators", "24/7 customer support with emergency 24-hour device service", "On-demand delivery and pickup with equipment ready at arrival", "Operations across 13 states with hospitality and entertainment partnerships", "Full mobility management including reservations, cleaning, and maintenance"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2003 by Bryan Schultz -> /about", "Headquartered in Las Vegas, Nevada -> /about", "Operates in 13 states -> /about, /", "Primary service: mobility scooter and medical device rentals -> /about", "Serves hospitality and entertainment industries -> /about, /", "Partners with hotels and entertainment complexes -> /about", "24/7 customer support and emergency 24-hour service -> /about", "On-demand delivery and pickup -> /", "FAA-approved portable oxygen concentrator rentals, one of three providers nationally -> /", "Mobility management including