UPDATE companies SET description='Digicom Electronics, a certified small business, has been manufacturing electronics in Oakland, California since 1982. The company operates as a subsidiary of India-based Kaynes Technology Group, combining U.S.-based production with global supply-chain resources.

The shop provides end-to-end electronic manufacturing services, including printed circuit board assembly (surface-mount, through-hole, and mixed technology), cable and wire harness fabrication, box build, and full test sequences such as functional, burn-in, optical, and X-ray inspection. An advanced high-speed SMT line supports larger volumes, while a newly expanded stock room and kitting operation feed quick-turn prototypes and low- to mid-volume production runs. Turnkey and consignment programs are managed with dedicated program oversight.

Customers span aerospace, defense, medical devices, industrial automation, IT and telecommunications, and railway sectors. A noted project includes the ROACH system built for CASPER and radio astronomy institutes, which contributed to the first image of a black hole. The firm emphasizes secure, compliant builds for defense-grade electronics and precision manufacturing for life-saving medical innovations.

Digicom differentiates itself through its ITAR-registered, U.S.-based facility, AS9100/ISO 9001/ISO 13485/NADCAP certifications, and the backing of Kaynes Group’s international scale. The company quotes standard builds in two business days and complex new-product introductions in five, and it specializes in small runs, NPI support, and design-to-troubleshoot assistance for challenging electronic products.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','AS9100','ISO 13485','NADCAP','ITAR']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Printed Circuit Board Assembly (PCBA)", "Surface Mount Technology (SMT) assembly", "Through-hole assembly", "Mixed technology assembly", "Selective soldering", "Manual assembly & soldering", "Cable harness assembly", "Wire harness assembly", "Box build / final assembly", "Functional testing", "Burn-in testing", "In-circuit testing", "Optical inspection", "X-ray inspection", "Cleaning", "Procurement & supply chain management", "Component kitting", "Receiving & incoming inspection", "Turnkey manufacturing", "Consignment manufacturing", "Program management", "Rapid prototyping", "Low to mid-volume production", "Flexible circuits and RF capabilities"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Defense", "Medical Devices", "Industrial", "IT & Telecommunications", "Railways"], "materials": ["Lead-free solder", "Tin-lead solder", "Electronic components", "Printed circuit boards"], "equipment": ["Laser-guided solder paste printer", "Wave soldering system", "High-throughput convection reflow oven", "Pick and place machines", "SMT line"], "volume": "Prototype to mid-volume production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["U.S.-based ITAR-registered facility in Oakland, California", "Subsidiary of Kaynes Technology Group for global supply-chain scale", "Certified to AS9100, ISO 9001, ISO 13485, and NADCAP", "Standard quotes in 2 business days; complex NPI quotes in 5 business days", "Specializes in small runs, NPIs, and design/development support"], "facts_used": ["Foun