UPDATE companies SET description='Domico Med-Device is based in Fenton, Michigan. The company became an independent business after spinning out of a larger organization, driven by a vision to serve as a supplier of high-quality medical products worldwide.

The company designs, develops, and manufactures patient interface solutions for diagnostic imaging, image-guided therapy, and surgical applications. Its vertically integrated capabilities include compression molding, foam fabrication, machining, tool design and build, sewing, sealing, coating, vacuum forming, and final product assembly. Materials processed range from carbon fiber and thermoplastic sheets such as ABS, Kydex, and polycarbonate to open- and closed-cell foams and vinyl coatings. Domico reports serving over 650,000 product users each month with a 99% on-time shipment rate and a 99.8% customer acceptance rate.

Domico serves healthcare professionals, distributors, OEMs, and product inventors in the medical device industry. Its product portfolio includes MRI positioning aids, operating room cord management and arm positioning devices, and a range of table pads designed for secure support and pressure relief. The company also provides contract manufacturing of components and assemblies for medical device OEMs.

Domico emphasizes its vertically integrated model—taking products from concept to market under one roof—to streamline timelines, reduce risk, and ensure consistency. The company states its mission is to empower healthcare innovation by delivering reliable, compliant manufacturing solutions that improve patient outcomes and enhance operational efficiency.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 13485:2016','ISO 11137-1:2006/Amd 2:2018','ISO 11135:2014/Amd 1:2018','FDA Registered']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Compression Molding", "Foam Fabrication", "Machining", "Tool Design and Build", "Sewing", "Sealing", "Coating", "Vacuum Forming", "Product Assembly", "Product Design & Development", "Contract Manufacturing"], "industries": ["Medical Device Manufacturing", "Diagnostic Imaging", "Image-Guided Therapy", "Surgical Applications"], "materials": ["Carbon Fiber", "Open-cell Foam", "Closed-cell Foam", "Vinyl", "ABS", "Kydex", "Polycarbonate", "PE", "PU", "Nonwoven Materials"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["FDA-registered and ISO 13485:2016 certified facility", "99% on-time shipment performance", "Vertically integrated concept-to-market capabilities under one roof", "Serves 650,000+ product users monthly", "99.8% customer acceptance rate"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Fenton, Michigan -> /about-us", "Became independent from larger organization -> /about-us", "Capabilities: compression molding, foam fabrication, machining, tool design and build, sewing, sealing, coating, vacuum forming, product assembly -> /", "Materials: carbon fiber, thermoplastic sheets (ABS, Kydex, polycarbonate), open/closed-cell foam, vinyl -> /", "Scale metrics: 650,000+ product users monthly, 99% on-time shipments, 99.8% customer acceptance -> /about-us", "Industries: medical device manufacturing, diagnostic imaging, image-guided therapy, surgical applications -> /", "Customer types: healthcare professionals, distributors, OEMs, inventors -> /", "Prod