UPDATE companies SET description='ECS Sheet Metal operates as a family-owned and operated fabrication shop in Fort Smith, Arkansas. The company, also known as Environmental Control Systems, LLC, has served the region since its founding, though a specific year is not publicly disclosed. The owners emphasize a personal approach, treating every customer like family.

Core processes include spiral pipe production on a Spiral-Helix 3600 machine, coil line processing on an Engel Coil Line, TDC forming via a Lockformer TDC machine, and clinching with a Tog-L-loc 500. Products range from lock-seam and high-pressure round pipe to rectangular ducts, roof curbs (in stainless steel, phosphatized, galvalume, and aluminum), curb adapters, and custom fabrications. The facility runs modern equipment but does not publish facility size, headcount, or annual volume figures.

