UPDATE companies SET description='ELIS Manufacturing & Packaging Solutions operates from a single facility in Kaufman, Texas. The company began at a family kitchen table in Kaufman and has spent the last decade growing into a contract manufacturer whose clients’ products appear on shelves across the United States and internationally. It remains family-owned and founder-led, with Keith Vinson serving as owner and CEO; the name honors his grandfather, Ellis, whose work ethic the company says guides its operations.

ELIS provides turnkey contract manufacturing and packaging for nutraceuticals and consumables. Its services span product development, ingredient sourcing, blending, encapsulation, flavoring and formulating, filling (bottles, pouches, sachets, stick packs), printing (roll stock, pouch, screen printing on bottles), kitting, fulfillment, warehousing and shipping. The facility handles powders, liquids, creams, gels, tablets and capsules, and the company notes it applies the same quality standards to runs as small as 2,000 units and as large as 200,000 units.

The company serves brands in the nutraceutical, beauty and cosmetics, food and beverage, pet food and sports nutrition categories. Its customers include brands such as TryCinny.com, STROKESGAINED, Freedom Tea Co, Glucose SOS and Nutra Coast, whose products are stocked by major retailers nationwide.

ELIS was created after its founders experienced unreliable co-packers while launching their own product line. They built the company to offer a design-to-delivery partner under one roof, with a dedicated project manager who knows each product’s timeline and launch window, and a team that treats every client’s product as its own.', certifications=ARRAY['NSF/ANSI 455 GMP Certification','FDA Registered Facility','CCOF Organic Certification','Halal Certification']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Contract manufacturing", "Blending", "Encapsulation", "Flavoring & formulating", "Filling & packaging (bottle, pouch, sachet, stick pack)", "Roll stock & pouch printing", "Screen printing on bottles", "Kitting & fulfillment", "Warehousing & shipping", "Product development", "Ingredient sourcing", "Order fulfillment", "Supplement manufacturing", "Value-added services (printing, kitting, warehousing, shipping)"], "industries": ["Nutraceuticals", "Beauty & Cosmetics", "Food & Beverage", "Pet Food", "Sports Nutrition"], "materials": ["Powders", "Liquids", "Creams & Gels", "Tablets & Capsules"], "equipment": [], "volume": "2,000 to 200,000 units", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Turnkey design-to-delivery under one roof", "GMP (NSF/ANSI 455), FDA-registered, CCOF Organic, Halal certified", "Family-owned, founder-led with dedicated project managers", "Single Kaufman, Texas facility serving global retail", "Founded by brand owners to solve co-packer reliability"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Kaufman, Texas -> /about", "Founded at family kitchen table in Kaufman, Texas -> /about", "Family-owned, founder-led, ten years in business -> /about", "Keith Vinson Owner & CEO, named after grandfather Ellis -> /about", "Turnkey contract manufacturing and packaging for nutraceuticals and consumables -> /", "Services: product development, ingredient sourcing, blending, encapsulation, flavoring/formulating, filling, printing, kitting, fulfillment, warehousing, shipping -> /