UPDATE companies SET description='East Lake Axle operates from Oldsmar, Florida, where it was established to supply high-performance driveline components for off-road vehicles at economical prices. The company eliminates middlemen by purchasing in volume directly from factories around the world, passing on the benefits of quality control, design engineering, and purchasing power to customers.

The company distributes a wide range of parts for ATVs, UTVs, golf carts, and snowmobiles, including complete transmissions, differentials, axles, ball joints, wheel bearings, belts, carriers, primary clutches, wheel hubs, shocks, U-joints, knuckles, and seat covers. All products are backed by a two-year fault-free warranty, and orders over $62 receive free two-day shipping within the contiguous United States.

Its catalog covers major off-road vehicle types, and the company emphasizes direct-to-consumer pricing through its global supply chain.

